Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.60,0:00:12.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is how intelligence is made.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.76,0:00:15.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,A new kind of factory.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.56,0:00:17.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Generator of tokens.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.88,0:00:24.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,The building blocks of AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.72,0:00:27.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Tokens have opened a new frontier.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.76,0:00:36.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Turning data into knowledge, reason, action.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.76,0:00:39.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,They reveal patterns in complexity.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.44,0:00:47.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,We could never see.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.52,0:00:49.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Mirror our cities.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.40,0:00:57.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,To keep us safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.24,0:00:59.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,And lift us high.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.00,0:01:05.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Above them.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.24,0:01:12.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Tokens help robots learn from us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.80,0:01:22.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Work alongside us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.28,0:01:30.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,They go where we cannot.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.36,0:01:35.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Lending us helping hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.68,0:01:39.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,And closing the gap between hope and healing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.00,0:01:45.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,So that we breathe easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.44,0:01:46.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the smallest
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.77,0:01:47.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,hearts
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.32,0:01:52.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,beat
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.01,0:02:04.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.40,0:02:09.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Tokens are helping us break new
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.01,0:02:13.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,ground on a
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.85,0:02:16.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,scale
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.99,0:02:25.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,never attempted.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.88,0:02:28.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,So we can reach Starcloud
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.20,0:02:30.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,1 separation confirmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.28,0:02:40.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,to infinity and beyond.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.40,0:02:40.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Together,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.97,0:02:44.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,we take the next great leap into
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.78,0:02:49.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,a bright new future
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.68,0:02:58.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,built for all mankind.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.92,0:03:01.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,And here in Taipei
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.00,0:03:06.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,is where
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.77,0:03:14.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,it all begins.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.72,0:03:15.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Welcome to the stage,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.01,0:03:17.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,NVIDIA founder and
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.12,0:03:19.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,CEO
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.80,0:03:29.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Jensen Huang.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.16,0:03:35.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Welcome to GTC Taiwan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.12,0:03:38.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,So great to see all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.44,0:03:39.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,Very good to be home.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.90,0:03:41.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,I brought my parents home.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.40,0:03:42.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Where are my parents?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.40,0:03:52.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Everybody give round of applause to my mom and dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.08,0:04:00.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,And a round of applause for our pre-game show superstars,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.49,0:04:04.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,ladies and gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.92,0:04:08.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Look how adorable they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.52,0:04:10.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,The superstars of Taiwan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.00,0:04:12.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh there are so many of you here today.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.60,0:04:21.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,We are broadcasting this right now to 70 other watch parties across Taiwan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.12,0:04:24.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,70 different conferences are going at the same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.70,0:04:26.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,Everybody is watching this keynote.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.99,0:04:31.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,We have so much to tell you, and I have so many partners to thank.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.44,0:04:36.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,It is incredible how large our ecosystem in Taiwan has become.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.76,0:04:41.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Most of the time, when people think about ecosystem, they think about our software stack.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.92,0:04:47.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,They think about the developer ecosystem above the computing systems that NVIDIA builds.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.04,0:04:56.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,But NVIDIA's ecosystem spans all the way upstream to all of our supply chain here in Taiwan,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.09,0:05:03.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,where it all begins, and downstream all the way to data centers and eventually to end users.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.40,0:05:07.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,Today, we're going to talk about almost all of the ecosystem.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.06,0:05:09.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,There's so many people to thank.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.28,0:05:12.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,I love my ecosystem here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.20,0:05:14.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,I mean, there's so many companies here,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.64,0:05:16.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,and some of my favorite ecosystem
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.40,0:05:51.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,partners
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.16,0:05:53.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,So many
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.28,0:05:56.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Taiwan's rich ecosystem.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.80,0:06:01.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,The richest ecosystem, the world's best supply chain ecosystem.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.78,0:06:02.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.84,0:06:04.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Well, thank you all for being here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.96,0:06:10.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,And uh this year this year our businesses together are growing incredibly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.33,0:06:10.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,In fact,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.00,0:06:14.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,somebody told me last night that the annual
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.90,0:06:25.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,GDP of Taiwan is going to grow almost 10%.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.00,0:06:26.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,Unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.03,0:06:29.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Well, we have a lot to talk about.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.60,0:06:30.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.84,0:06:39.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Two years ago when I was here, I started to talk to you about how AI has moved from generative AI and the other waves of AIs that are coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.32,0:06:42.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,The next wave of AI was agentic AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.76,0:06:49.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,And today we can say that agentic AI has arrived, that useful AI has arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.64,0:06:51.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, what does this mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.54,0:06:52.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is GitHub.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.57,0:06:58.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is of course one of the first applications of agentic AI is software coding.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.64,0:07:01.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,One of the most valuable professions.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.44,0:07:03.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Incredibly large ecosystem.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.65,0:07:07.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,30 million, 40 million professional software developers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.00,0:07:14.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,Probably another couple of hundred who are students and enthusiasts and so on and so forth.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.54,0:07:20.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,But say 30, 40 million software developers in the world code for a living.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.76,0:07:23.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,And this represents most of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.34,0:07:24.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is GitHub.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.45,0:07:31.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,The pull request is when they download software, they modify it, and commit is when they push it back up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.04,0:07:32.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.48,0:07:42.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so if you could look at this in 20 23 the number of commits was 300 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.72,0:07:47.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,2024 400 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.12,0:07:51.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,2025 500 million commits.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.96,0:07:59.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,In the first few months in the first few months of 2026, it has nearly tripled.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.50,0:08:02.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, what does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.80,0:08:12.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,30 million software developers representing about 3 trillion dollars worth of GDP producing three That's what they're paid.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.99,0:08:22.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,3 trillion dollars worth of salaries per year, which is generating economic growth for the rest of the industries.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.20,0:08:31.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,Say 100 trillion dollars of the world's industries is impacted is generated by 3 billion dollars worth of salary.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.28,0:08:33.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,That 3 trillion dollars Excuse me, 3 trillion.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.72,0:08:42.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,That 3 trillion dollars worth of salary is now producing nearly three times as much output.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.64,0:08:51.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's effectively a 9 trillion dollar productivity from 3 trillion dollars of salaries.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.32,0:08:53.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Does that make any sense?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.12,0:08:55.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,The difference is absolutely extraordinary.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.65,0:08:56.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the potential.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.76,0:08:58.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the promise of AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.76,0:09:01.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,The number of engineers, software engineers, is actually increasing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.96,0:09:04.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,People talk about AI reducing jobs.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.00,0:09:06.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Complete nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.56,0:09:12.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's causing more software engineers to be hired and the reason for that is very simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.32,0:09:19.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you can hire a software engineer and you could generate 9 trillion dollars worth of productive work,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.67,0:09:23.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,why wouldn't you want to hire more software engineers?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.72,0:09:29.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,If that line was flat then obviously people will hire fewer software engineers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.98,0:09:34.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,But because the output is so incredible, people want to hire more software engineers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.31,0:09:37.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is going to show up in our economy somehow soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.96,0:09:40.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, the first thing is useful AI has arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.95,0:09:44.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, what does that mean from the industry's perspective?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.12,0:09:50.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,From the industry's perspective, that means that tokens are now in extraordinary demand.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.19,0:09:53.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Because if you could do this, you're going to want to produce more of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.28,0:09:57.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,And because tokens are now profitable units.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.20,0:10:02.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Tokens are now prof- profitable units of revenues.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.12,0:10:08.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Because it is now profitable, the AI companies want to build a lot more tokens, generate a lot more tokens,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.88,0:10:16.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,build more AI factories, which is the reason why compute demand here in Taiwan has skyrocketed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.48,0:10:22.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,It is precisely the reason why all of you are so busy and your businesses are doing so well.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.84,0:10:34.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,In fact, that looks like some of your stock price.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.08,0:10:36.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,The compute pattern has changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.64,0:10:38.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,Everything has changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.70,0:10:42.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, the first idea is that useful AI has arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.52,0:10:45.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,AI is now a profit generator.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.20,0:10:48.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,AI is now a GDP generator.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.23,0:10:52.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,And behind it is a whole new kind of computing pattern.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.28,0:10:55.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Not just a large language model, but an agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.32,0:10:59.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,Today, almost everything we're going to talk about is going to be based on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.79,0:11:03.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, let me take a quick moment and show you what I'm talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.92,0:11:06.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Inside in this is a This is an agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.92,0:11:09.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's an agent application.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.72,0:11:13.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,In the old days, this would be application.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.68,0:11:15.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,This would be code.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.92,0:11:19.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,And this would be operating system.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.72,0:11:25.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Application, code running inside an application inside an operating system.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.12,0:11:26.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,Today, it is agent,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.43,0:11:33.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,which consists of a large language model or many sitting inside a
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.33,0:11:39.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,harness and that harness helps it orchestrates it to do productive work.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.88,0:11:41.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the input.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.52,0:11:50.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,When that input comes, it has to understand, observe, reason, act, use tools, use tools.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.18,0:11:58.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,That tool could be a spreadsheet, web browser, a data processing engine, database engine, for example.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.16,0:12:09.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is orchestrated this harness orchestrate this routing of information every single time it touches either processing the context,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.84,0:12:18.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,understanding what is happening, reasoning about what to do, coming up with a plan that you can act that it acts on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.82,0:12:23.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,That orchestration path is orchestrated by some software.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.60,0:12:26.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so this is fundamentally a agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.59,0:12:34.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,It deals with short-term memory, called working memory, long-term memory, just like we do, we have long-term memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.26,0:12:37.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so the memory management system is incredibly important.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.01,0:12:42.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,This entire system is called an agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.08,0:12:52.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,The large language model is used to do the thinking and the harness connects everything together, just like an operating system.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.92,0:12:53.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.28,0:12:57.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so this is the new computing model and this is what an agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.60,0:12:59.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,It could do incredible things.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.19,0:13:01.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the big breakthrough.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.28,0:13:10.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,The simultaneous convert the convergence of large language models that are now able to do a really good job thinking, reasoning, planning,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.85,0:13:20.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,using tools, and the fact that we have now these harnesses that manages memory, the orchestration, uses tools, we can now do amazing things.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.71,0:13:22.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let me give you some example.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.76,0:13:24.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is This is a prompt.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.10,0:13:26.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the prompt.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.44,0:13:32.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the code that is generated and this comes out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.44,0:13:35.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the input.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.48,0:13:40.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the input and that's the output.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.52,0:13:41.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,Do you guys What do you guys think?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.50,0:13:47.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's pretty amazing, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.60,0:13:50.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Dude, we use cloud code here, but Codex it does an incredible job as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.92,0:13:52.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Here's another example.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.60,0:13:54.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the input,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.10,0:14:03.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,create a GIF NVIDIA green dots on black scatter form Taiwan 101 building morph
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.23,0:14:09.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,2 GTC type A 2 2026 morph 2 NVIDIA eye logo then scatter and repeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.60,0:14:09.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.94,0:14:10.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, you saw that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.81,0:14:11.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,That was the prompt.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.98,0:14:13.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Here's the next one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.40,0:14:15.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,I lost my remote control battery clip.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.79,0:14:17.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,It looks like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.34,0:14:19.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,Create a CAD file.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.11,0:14:20.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,It uses a tool.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.46,0:14:26.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Create a CAD file ready for 3D printing to create a new new one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.12,0:14:27.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Make sense?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.56,0:14:30.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is now the new computing pattern.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.20,0:14:41.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Whereas we used to launch an application, click and type, we now replace that with explaining to the AI what we want,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.04,0:14:50.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,our intent, and the AI generates the code or uses tools and produce the necessary output.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.44,0:14:54.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is how computers are going to work in the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.56,0:14:57.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is agentic AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.08,0:15:00.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,For 2 years we've been building towards this and now it has arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.69,0:15:05.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, one of the big breakthroughs, of course, is tool use.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.08,0:15:09.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,A lot of people have said, "You know, Jensen, AI's coming, agentic AI's coming,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.62,0:15:12.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,therefore all of the software companies are going to go out of business."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.96,0:15:22.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,I said it's exactly the opposite because there are going to be so many agents, the world is no longer at by the number of people.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.68,0:15:28.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Therefore, those agents are going to use more tools than ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.44,0:15:32.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is actually an incredible time to be a software company.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.28,0:15:38.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,But the software has to be presented to the agent in a way that the agent can use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.88,0:15:48.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is a break big breakthrough and in fact what we have done, as you know, what Nvidia's treasure is is all of our CUDA libraries.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.05,0:15:49.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,I call them CUDA-X libraries.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.95,0:15:52.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is Nvidia's treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.24,0:16:03.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Today, we're able to now pre- present these CUDA-X libraries to agents who can use it much more effectively than even hu- humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.45,0:16:07.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, this is a wonderful time for CUDA-X libraries.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.86,0:16:10.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.00,0:16:16.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,20 years ago, we built CUDA, a single architecture for accelerated computing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.88,0:16:19.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,We reinvented computing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.20,0:16:26.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,A thousand CUDA-X libraries help developers make breakthroughs in every field of science and engineering.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.36,0:16:33.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,CUDA-X libraries are tools for agents. cuLitho for computational
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.36,0:16:43.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,lithography. cuOpt for decision optimization. cuDSS for direct sparse solvers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.72,0:16:49.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,AIQ for deep research across structured and unstructured documents.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.36,0:16:53.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Aerial for AI-RAN.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.76,0:16:57.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Warp for differentiable physics.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.52,0:17:00.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Parabricks for genomics.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.36,0:17:02.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,At their foundation are
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.31,0:17:03.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,algorithms and
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.77,0:17:04.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,they
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.48,0:17:50.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,are
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.82,0:19:58.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.24,0:20:01.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,A round of applause for math.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.28,0:20:08.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Math is beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.24,0:20:12.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,The computing pattern the computing pattern of software is going to change.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.80,0:20:15.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,In fact, let's come back to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.24,0:20:17.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.06,0:20:25.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,It is the ultimate disaggregated and distributed computing computing model.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.64,0:20:31.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,So many different computers are going to be activated in order to process this agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.14,0:20:36.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,The agent consists of model, harness,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.96,0:20:43.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,tools and skills, and a runtime.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.16,0:20:48.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,All of that is running at different places in a data center.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.20,0:20:52.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,You can think of the model as the brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.20,0:20:55.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,The harness as the body.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.24,0:21:02.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,The tools that it uses working in a runtime, think of it as a workshop.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.60,0:21:08.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,So this is a person a worker working with tools in a workshop.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.20,0:21:11.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Of course, this is being done at extraordinarily large scales.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.04,0:21:16.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,And each one of those steps are running in a different part of the computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.00,0:21:21.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,And you could see the large language model is thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.16,0:21:30.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,Context processing, observing, understanding the environment, reasoning, coming up with a plan, and acting on the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.70,0:21:38.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Every single time that happens, an entire rack of Grace Blackwell NVLink 72 is activated.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.17,0:21:41.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's thinking with the large language model.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.68,0:21:46.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Whenever it uses a tool, a CPU use is used.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.08,0:21:48.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,That tool could be a C compiler.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.91,0:21:50.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,It could be Python.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.28,0:21:51.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,It could be JavaScript.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.97,0:21:55.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Or it could be accelerated computing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.12,0:21:59.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Today's agents are relatively simple users of tools.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.92,0:22:03.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow, they're going to be very sophisticated users of tools,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.40,0:22:09.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,which is the reason why the CUDA-X libraries that I showed you are going to be incredibly popular with agents.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.76,0:22:13.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,They solve some of the most important problems the world knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.24,0:22:22.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,And all of our CUDA-X libraries are now now going to come with skills that the AI could learn how to use.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.68,0:22:32.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, the CUDA-X library, some skills, basically a manual, the AI reads it and go, "Aha, that's how you use it."
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.24,0:22:36.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,The ability to use these libraries by agents are going to be incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.63,0:22:42.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, the tools run on CPUs and GPUs and large language models.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.20,0:22:50.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,The security harness runs on CPUs and a security processor called a DPU, NVIDIA's BlueField.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.60,0:22:53.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,The orchestration of all this runs on a CPU.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.85,0:22:59.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the entire harness, and the CPU's orchestrating all of the work.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.48,0:23:02.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,One of the hardest parts is memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.07,0:23:12.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,You could just imagine the working memory is called KV caching, what to remember, compaction, not just compression, but how to retrieve.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.20,0:23:14.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Do you retrieve structured data?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.05,0:23:16.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Do you retrieve unstructured data?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.80,0:23:22.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,What is the ontology, the relationship of all of these different data to itself?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.44,0:23:25.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,That entire processing is incredibly complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.91,0:23:34.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,The memory system the memory system of AIs is going to cause the storage system to be completely revolutionized.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.68,0:23:41.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,As you could see, every aspect of this computing model, this computing pattern,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.86,0:23:48.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,this new application called an agent, is fundamentally different than the way that applications used to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.88,0:23:54.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,A whole bunch of software sitting inside a binary sitting inside an operating system.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.36,0:23:58.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the reason this disaggregated,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.16,0:24:09.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,this distributed this heterogeneous computing problem is precisely the reason we built our next generation Vera Rubin.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.92,0:24:12.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Vera Rubin is not one chip.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.72,0:24:15.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Vera Rubin is not a GPU only.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.33,0:24:21.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,It starts with a GPU, but Vera Rubin is incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.96,0:24:25.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,This entire thing is Vera Rubin.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.00,0:24:27.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,From end to end.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.92,0:24:30.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,It has GPUs.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.12,0:24:32.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Vera Rubin NVLink 72.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.76,0:24:36.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,It is orchestrated by Vera CPUs that I'm going to tell you more about.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.63,0:24:40.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,The storage systems revolutionary.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.18,0:24:45.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Vera along with CX9, our software stack called DOCA.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.28,0:24:56.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,The security processor that's inside so that everything is encrypted at rest, in motion, as well as in use.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.64,0:25:01.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Everything across this is secure because the AI model is so precious.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.64,0:25:07.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the reason why this entire system obeys confidential computing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.56,0:25:12.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Each one of these systems would be a complete revolution in itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.12,0:25:18.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Vera Rubin is the most ambitious endeavor in the history of our company.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.60,0:25:23.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,The whole company worked on Vera Rubin across all 40,000 engineers.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.64,0:25:26.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Not to mention all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.24,0:25:30.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,All of you participated in the creation of this entire system.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.48,0:25:36.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Vera Rubin is really a miracle and it's not just one chip, it is so many.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.72,0:25:39.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Well, it's even beyond that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.20,0:25:42.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,A long time ago Nvidia used to be a GPU company.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.76,0:25:48.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,But over the years we've evolved to become a systems company.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.36,0:25:55.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're looking here now for the most complex systems, most complex and ground-up system ever designed.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.00,0:26:02.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,But ultimately, our customers, our partners don't want to buy computers.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.96,0:26:10.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,They want to build AI factories, which is the reason why Nvidia has really started to transform ourselves yet again.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.96,0:26:17.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,You could see so much of our technology is now at the entire infrastructure scale.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.20,0:26:20.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Our partners are at infrastructure scale.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.44,0:26:24.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Power generators, cooling systems, the grid providers.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.00,0:26:34.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,So many industrial companies are now part of our ecosystem because ultimately, we're trying to build an entire stack just like GPUs,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.66,0:26:41.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,just like when we were building Grace Blackwell NVLink 72, just like now,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.40,0:26:49.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,we are building a full-stack system so that our customers could build amazing AI infrastructure.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.86,0:26:52.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.08,0:26:58.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,The world is racing to build AI factories, the largest infrastructure build-out in human history.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.52,0:27:04.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,AI factories are incredibly complex, every layer, chip, rack, network, power,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.94,0:27:13.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,cooling, grid, must be designed together from end to end because compute is revenues.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.64,0:27:23.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,NVIDIA DSX is the blueprint, a reference design for building and operating AI factories at maximum efficiency and profitability.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.40,0:27:25.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,It starts with DSX Sim.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.80,0:27:34.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,With the DSX Sim Omniverse blueprint, partners design and validate an NVIDIA Vera Rubin AI factory before a single rack lands.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.88,0:27:39.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,They plan the layout.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.24,0:27:43.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Simulate the power and cooling.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.44,0:27:44.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Design the network.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.65,0:27:46.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,Validate every integration.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.35,0:27:50.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Test every change in the digital twin.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.60,0:27:52.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,The factory powers on.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.52,0:27:59.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,DSX OS takes over and provisions, operates, monitors, and remediates the infrastructure.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.48,0:28:08.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Turning the installed systems into trusted, multi-tenant, resilient, AI-ready capacity.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.20,0:28:12.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,Today's AI factories over provision power by up to 40%.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.70,0:28:19.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,DSX Max LPS lets operators safely deploy more GPUs inside the same power budget.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.24,0:28:24.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Adding billions in annual revenue.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.64,0:28:30.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Breakthrough hot liquid cooling at 45° C uses less water and energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.48,0:28:33.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,More power going to revenue-generating compute.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.00,0:28:36.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.16,0:28:44.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Dynamic power allocation steers power from rack to rack, recovering stranded watts, sending them where work is happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.92,0:28:53.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,In-rack power smoothing flattens peak current spikes and power surges.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.12,0:29:03.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Throughout the factory, teams of AI agents work with DSX Max LPS, continuously coordinating to balance cooling and power to meet workload demand.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.48,0:29:09.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,DSX AI factories are flexible energy assets that operate cooperatively with the grid.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.48,0:29:19.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,DSX Flex reads real-time grid signals and dynamically adjusts factory power when the grid needs relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.88,0:29:24.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,A 100 gigawatts of AI factories will come online before the end of the decade.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.72,0:29:28.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,Nvidia DSX AI factories run at highest efficiency,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.51,0:29:30.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,produce the lowest cost tokens,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.54,0:29:41.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,and make the grid stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.60,0:29:45.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,I've shown you ecosystem slides of the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.76,0:29:53.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Where Nvidia's computing layers and software and software and computing stacks are integrated into other people's platforms,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.56,0:29:57.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,third-party platforms and libraries that serves end markets.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.51,0:30:00.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,That was a computing ecosystem.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.60,0:30:03.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is an AI factory ecosystem.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.44,0:30:06.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is way downstream of all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.56,0:30:12.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Upstream of me is all of you and downstream of us is this ecosystem.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.44,0:30:18.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,Because Nvidia ultimately is not just building a GPU, not just building a system,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.63,0:30:26.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,we're helping customers build these AI factories, these AI infrastructure that is so immensely complex.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.28,0:30:33.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,Each one of these at 1 gigawatt level started at 30 20 30 billion dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.66,0:30:42.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,It is at 50 60 billion dollars and soon it will be 80 100 billion dollars per gigawatt.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.44,0:30:46.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,100 billion dollars into an AI factory.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.92,0:30:50.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,It must work the first time and it must work right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.44,0:30:52.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,The cost of capital is incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.85,0:30:55.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,The complexity is incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.23,0:31:00.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, as you see, we used to design a chip inside a computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.64,0:31:04.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,And then we simulated a system inside a computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.92,0:31:11.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Today, you saw just now, everything was built in Omniverse.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.36,0:31:14.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,I've been working with Omniverse with all of you for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.64,0:31:16.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,This was the dream come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.96,0:31:24.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, that we can build these gigantic systems as large as the world wants to build inside a digital framework,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.21,0:31:33.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,inside a digital simulator, in a digital world long before we build the first break ground and put our money to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.73,0:31:38.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, this is our ecosystem, our we call it DSX.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.16,0:31:39.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,RTX is for our GPU.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.99,0:31:42.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,DGX is for our systems.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.23,0:31:45.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,And now DSX, basically, infrastructure.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.48,0:31:51.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,Because of the work that we do here across this entire stack, including our systems and software,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.27,0:31:58.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,it's the reason why we could work with small companies and enable them to be world-class AI clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.56,0:32:03.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,Every one of these I'm about to show you are small companies just recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.11,0:32:08.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,And now CoreWeave is worth 50, 60, 70 billion dollars and growing incredibly fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.91,0:32:11.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Recently, we worked with Nebius.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.52,0:32:14.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,And again, they're growing incredibly fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.36,0:32:18.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Each one of these clouds have incredible customers.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.08,0:32:20.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Cursor, the software coding company.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.00,0:32:32.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Black Mountain Labs, image generation, World Labs, World Foundation model, Revolut, the leading financial services AI company, and Shopify.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.08,0:32:33.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Here's another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.05,0:32:38.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,There's this Enscape, and their customers are British Telecom, Google.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.72,0:32:44.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,Google is using one of our AI clouds, Thinking Machines, a Frontier Labs company.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.99,0:32:46.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're super exciting.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.32,0:32:48.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Here's Naver Cloud in Korea.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.92,0:32:54.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,Bank of Korea, Hyundai, so many incredible companies.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.10,0:32:57.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Here's one in in India, Yotta.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.88,0:32:59.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Incredible companies.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.44,0:33:05.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Here's one uh based in Singapore, building in Australia, Together AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.40,0:33:07.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,AI Singapore.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.32,0:33:09.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is one in Indonesia.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.40,0:33:16.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Each one of these companies, each one of these companies are serving regional as well as global customers.
