Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.38,0:48:17.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Do you remember that?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.44,0:48:19.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,People used to say, "Inference is so easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.61,0:48:21.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,We could do that, too."
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.40,0:48:24.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,But as you know, inference equals money.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.68,0:48:28.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the models, MOEs are so complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.48,0:48:38.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,And to do it at incredibly high response time fast interactivity, and high throughput at the same time is incredibly hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.36,0:48:41.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Which is the reason why we created NVLink 72.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.76,0:48:46.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Today, Nvidia's token cost is the lowest in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.68,0:48:51.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Not by 10%, by X factors, orders of magnitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.84,0:48:54.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,All because we did extreme co-design.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.96,0:49:03.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,All because we understood the computing model, the computing pattern of inference and we were able to create NVLink 72.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.72,0:49:08.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now with Vera Rubin it is beyond inference.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.73,0:49:12.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,It is now inference in an agentic agentic system.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.76,0:49:15.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is Vera Rubin.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.00,0:49:21.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,No cables no hoses, no fans.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.96,0:49:28.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,What used to take the last time when I showed this to you, we had cables everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.16,0:49:30.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,The cables were amazing to look at.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.72,0:49:36.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,But now there's a PCB in the middle which connects both sides.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.28,0:49:39.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,What used to take 2 hours now takes 5 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.50,0:49:45.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,The reliability and the resilience of Vera Rubin is going to be off the charts.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.72,0:49:49.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is our Vera CPU tray.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.28,0:49:52.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,The most advanced CPUs that has ever been built.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.81,0:49:55.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm going to show you that in just a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.64,0:49:59.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,And this is our storage tray.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.84,0:50:07.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Two Vera CPUs, four CX 9, incredible amounts of software.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.80,0:50:17.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is our new LPX LPU 30, the Groq system designed for very low latency inference.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.16,0:50:23.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,The throughput is delivered by Vera Rubin and extended with NVLink 72.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.88,0:50:29.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you want to extend that even further, you can have Groq LPUs.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.72,0:50:33.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,Here, we have the Vera Rubin NVLink, the switch tray.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.54,0:50:38.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the switches in the middle, and this is revolutionary.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.52,0:50:46.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Because of Vera Rubins, because of NVLink 72, and the NVLink switches that we created and invented,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.36,0:50:52.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,and this is our Ethernet switches for scale out.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.24,0:50:58.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,What's amazing is we introduced these two systems for Grace Blackwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.96,0:51:07.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,These two systems were created for Grace Blackwell, and today, NVIDIA is the largest networking company in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.48,0:51:10.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm so proud of the networking team.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.12,0:51:14.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is such an incredible enabler for everything that we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.68,0:51:21.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm going to now talk to you about the next major industry we're going to be part of.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.16,0:51:22.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.32,0:51:24.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Jen-Hsun.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.52,0:51:30.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.48,0:51:35.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Jensen.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.92,0:51:44.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,I think there are 2,000 people back there pulling that.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.60,0:51:49.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's talk about CPUs.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.56,0:51:51.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Vera CPUs.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.28,0:51:54.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,CPUs built for the age of AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.52,0:52:00.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,All of the CPUs until now were created for people.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.28,0:52:02.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,We were the users.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.72,0:52:04.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,We were the users.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.45,0:52:06.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,We were the renters.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.36,0:52:12.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,The way we use CPUs, we live in a world counted by seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.24,0:52:21.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,The way we rent CPUs in the cloud, each one of them more you can more CPU cores you have, the more you can rent.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.16,0:52:30.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,The economics of the old the use case of the old CPU and the economics of the old CPU fundamentally different than agents.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.28,0:52:33.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Agents are impatient.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.88,0:52:35.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,They don't live in a world that is in seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.88,0:52:39.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,They live in a world that's in nanoseconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.16,0:52:45.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,When it uses a tool, it wants the response time to be as fast as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.56,0:52:50.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,When it access database, it has to come back as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.28,0:52:58.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Every moment that the agent is waiting keeps it from going to the next step, the next step, the next step.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.72,0:53:07.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,It is vital that we make the CPUs as low latency as possible, as interactive as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.76,0:53:12.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, we created Vera CPU for the age of AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.08,0:53:15.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, inside our system, it's used for three different ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.83,0:53:23.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,The first way, of course, is Vera Rubin for thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.48,0:53:28.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,And inside the Vera Rubin rack, there already two CPUs.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.32,0:53:34.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,As you know, we are building and selling millions of Vera Rubins.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.00,0:53:38.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,We have sold millions of Grace Blackwells.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.13,0:53:42.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Nvidia already is one of the largest CPU makers in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.24,0:53:46.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Vera In the Vera Rubin rack are two CPUs.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.28,0:53:54.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,One for orchestrating and managing the GPUs, managing the KV cache,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.36,0:53:58.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,dealing with all of the software that runs in the rack.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.44,0:54:05.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,We also have the Grace BlueField that is used for security and isolation.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.20,0:54:15.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Vera compute is used for the harness, the orchestration of the AI models, tool use, accessing the database.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.28,0:54:20.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the data servers are right here, Vera BlueField.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.20,0:54:26.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,The fastest storage fastest storage servers, the fastest storage system the world has ever made.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.56,0:54:34.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the reason why this is so vital is because agents are accessing memory, accessing memory so incredibly fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.04,0:54:46.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,These systems, the storage server and the CPUs are now the critical path of the most expensive part of the data center.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.68,0:54:50.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the most expensive for a good reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.48,0:54:57.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,The economics the economics of the AI factory is tokens.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.40,0:55:00.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the tokens are created here.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.16,0:55:05.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so of course you want to manufacture and generate as many tokens as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.20,0:55:07.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is where you put all of your economics.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.58,0:55:11.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,And this has to not be in the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.16,0:55:21.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so Vera CPU has great pressure on the Vera on the CPU architecture, which is the reason why we built a brand new architecture from the ground up.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.54,0:55:24.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,A CPU the world has never seen before.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.16,0:55:26.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,We call it Vera.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.52,0:55:30.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is CPU for agents.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.48,0:55:34.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,All the CPUs of the past we built for humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.44,0:55:37.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,This CPU is built for agents.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.40,0:55:39.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Well, there four things to keep in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.96,0:55:41.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,The four takeaways.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.92,0:55:52.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,The first takeaway is that the instructions per clock of Vera has to be incredibly good because we need the latency to be short.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.08,0:56:02.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,We need the processing time, single threaded performance, not throughput, single threaded performance has to be world-class, absolutely the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.40,0:56:09.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Single threaded performance, which is the reason why the IPC, the instructions per clock of Vera is so high.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.44,0:56:11.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's the highest in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.48,0:56:16.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,10 instructions fetch, decoded, and executed per clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.20,0:56:17.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Number one.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.84,0:56:19.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Number two.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.68,0:56:27.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,The bandwidth necessary to move data in and out for the CPU has to be utterly world-class.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.20,0:56:30.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,The second thing is bandwidth per core.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.72,0:56:33.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,The third is just bandwidth, period.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.92,0:56:43.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're moving Remember, I said earlier, agentic systems is fundamentally disaggregated and distributed.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.48,0:56:45.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,Disaggregated and distributed.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.79,0:56:51.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,When computing is disaggregated and distributed, networking becomes the problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.84,0:57:02.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Therefore, we have to move the data around as fast as possible between the CPU cores and between the CPU and the storage, the CPU and the GPU.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.28,0:57:09.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,The bandwidth around the system and inside the CPU core has to be utterly world-class.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.40,0:57:14.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the first CPU that's been built a long time that is literally at theoretical
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.86,0:57:21.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,limits with a fabric that connects all of the CPU cores that is speed of light.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.64,0:57:24.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,3.6 terabytes per second.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.72,0:57:26.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,No chiplet tax,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.68,0:57:36.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,no chip boundary crossings because we need to have everything because the CPU cores are talking to each other with extremely high bandwidth.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.41,0:57:39.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,They're not rented core per core per core.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.23,0:57:41.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,They're all working together.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.84,0:57:45.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,The cross-sectional bandwidth of Vera is off the charts.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.06,0:57:49.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's the first one to be PCI Express Gen 6.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.20,0:57:56.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,It is also the first one to have LPDDR5 with 1.2 terabytes per second.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.88,0:58:06.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Three times two to three times the bandwidth of the highest performance CPUs on the outside three times the bandwidth on the inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.80,0:58:11.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,The bandwidth per core and the bandwidth period is world class.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.60,0:58:19.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, remember I showed you earlier the number of CPU cores, the number of CPUs is going to be quite high.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.60,0:58:23.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the reason for that is very simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.36,0:58:28.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,We created CPUs for humans in the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.28,0:58:32.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,And humans, they're only 1 billion of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.08,0:58:35.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,There will be billions of agents.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.48,0:58:45.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,And these agents are going to be using the CPUs with very little patience because the cost of the GPU they sit next to is too high.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.08,0:58:49.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,And therefore too valuable, too precious.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.56,0:58:59.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Therefore, these CPUs are going to be both performant but they also have to be extremely energy efficient.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.20,0:59:10.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,So that we can cram as much CPUs we can into the factory without taking away power from the token generation, which we know is how we make money.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.92,0:59:12.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,These four properties,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.32,0:59:19.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,instructions per clock or single-threaded performance bandwidth per core the total bandwidth
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.84,0:59:25.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,around the chip and inside the chip and energy efficiency defines Vera.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.60,0:59:27.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,It is absolutely world class.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.79,0:59:33.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,When you compare it to the highest performance x86, it is just off the charts.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.56,0:59:42.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,When you compare it in real single-threaded performance, real performance, it's off the charts.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.68,0:59:46.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,It is incredible to be able to deliver 5% improvement on CPUs.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.04,0:59:50.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,It is incredible to be able to deliver 10%.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.88,0:59:55.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,But this kind of performance speed up is just unheard of.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.20,0:59:58.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is Nvidia Vera.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.64,1:00:05.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.64,1:00:08.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's take a look.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.12,1:00:11.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,A generative AI changes the role of the CPU.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.60,1:00:15.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,The CPU is now the conductor and the GPU is the orchestra.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.88,1:00:21.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Traditional CPUs were built for a different era, maximizing cores per socket.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.61,1:00:25.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Slice them up, virtualize, rent by the hour.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.88,1:00:36.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,In the age of agents, the CPU is now a bottleneck to GPU utilization, directly affecting token throughput, latency, and user experience.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.52,1:00:40.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,Nvidia Vera is the CPU built for the agentic loop,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.15,1:00:45.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,combining Nvidia's custom data center CPU core with a scalable coherency fabric for
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.84,1:00:50.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,the right balance of performance cores and bandwidth to maximize AI factory output.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.04,1:00:56.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,At the heart of Vera is the Nvidia Olympus core, built for modern data center workloads,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.81,1:01:02.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,branch-heavy Python runtimes, tool calls, and sandbox code execution.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.56,1:01:05.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Each core is tuned for throughput.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.13,1:01:13.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,A neural branch predictor evaluating two taken branches per cycle, a 10-wide decode engine brings in more work each cycle.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.32,1:01:16.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,A large out-of-order engine keeps instructions moving.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.42,1:01:21.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,Advanced prefetchers with a novel graph engine anticipating the next data path.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.62,1:01:27.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,But fast cores only matter when data arrives correctly and on time.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.20,1:01:36.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Vera is the first CPU to use LPDDR5X memory while correcting multiple errors simultaneously without compromising bandwidth.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.52,1:01:47.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Vera achieves 40% lower peak memory latency versus X86, keeping cores fed on time through retrieval, analytics, and sandbox execution.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.48,1:01:58.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Nvidia's second-generation scalable coherency fabric unifies all 88 Olympus cores on a monolithic mesh with separate dies for memory and IO.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.08,1:02:06.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Cores are not split across chiplets, enabling 50% faster core-to-core communication than traditional CPUs.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.56,1:02:12.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,And memory coherent NVLink chip-to-chip connects GPUs directly to the fabric.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.52,1:02:21.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Beyond GPUs, NVLink chip-to-chip can scale Vera up to multiple sockets, enabling massive bandwidth between CPUs.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.80,1:02:27.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Vera delivers 1.8 times the agentic sandbox performance of X86 CPUs.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.00,1:02:34.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Standalone Vera racks run agent sandboxes, tools, code, and data pipelines.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.20,1:02:39.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Tightly coupled to Rubin GPUs, Vera keeps accelerated workflows moving.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.60,1:02:46.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Nvidia Vera BlueField 4 STS powers context memory and AI storage.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.44,1:02:49.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Compute, networking, storage.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.76,1:03:00.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Vera is the CPU for the age of agents.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.96,1:03:03.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is going to be our new major growth driver.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.94,1:03:09.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,The reviews are already coming out and it's pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.00,1:03:18.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's pretty good stuff.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.72,1:03:22.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, remember,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.12,1:03:32.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Grace and Vera are also the most highly qualified CPUs in the world of AI because every single data center,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.32,1:03:41.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,every single cloud, every single enterprise, every company that works with NVIDIA on AI has already qualified Grace.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.39,1:03:45.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,The entire software stack has already been optimized for Grace.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.70,1:03:49.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Every company will be qualifying Vera.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.36,1:03:53.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Vera will be the most optimized agentic CPU in the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.68,1:03:56.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Simply because it's going to go with Vera Rubin.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.96,1:04:00.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Simply because we made the the big hard switch.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.68,1:04:10.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,In fact, during Grace Blackwell transition, the biggest risk was going from external CPU x86 into Grace Blackwell.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.24,1:04:13.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,That transition was extremely dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.52,1:04:16.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,But we did it with incredible execution.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.64,1:04:21.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now Grace is literally synonymous with Grace Blackwell.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.44,1:04:24.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,When people say Blackwell, they say Grace Blackwell.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.20,1:04:26.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Because it is utterly now everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.60,1:04:29.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Every company's software stack has been optimized for it.
