Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.24,1:05:32.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,Remember, your AI is going to be not just reading documents.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.02,1:05:40.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Your AI is going to be watching for telemetry, especially inside a factory, inside a stock exchange.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.04,1:05:44.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're going to be looking for telemetry continuously.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.20,1:05:48.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,The burst of data that's coming in goes into a CPU.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.48,1:05:54.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is Vera CPU running real-time stream processing for New York Stock Exchange.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.66,1:06:00.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Lynn Martin, the president of New York Stock Exchange, has been so gracious to partner with us.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.48,1:06:05.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,This system is run all over the world in real-time real-time stream processing.
