Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.51,1:06:48.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,We have an extraordinary road map coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.16,1:06:54.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,But, what's really exciting is almost everybody is supporting Vera.
