Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.64,1:07:55.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,And this will this this market will surely be larger than the last.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.94,1:08:00.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the reason for that is because there'll be a lot more agents than there are people.
