Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.50,1:08:09.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, Nvidia Vera CPU.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.09,1:08:13.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.68,1:08:15.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the most important slide, really.
