Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.88,1:08:21.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,The takeaway here is that this is the application pattern.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.20,1:08:26.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the computing pattern of the next decade.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.36,1:08:33.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Agents, harnesses, orchestrating large language models.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.20,1:08:35.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Every company will run it.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.96,1:08:39.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Every company will be an agent company.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.40,1:08:42.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Every company will have agents running inside.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.88,1:08:49.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Every company will see that agents will need its own operating system.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.92,1:08:54.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,Every company's asking us, "How do we run agents safely?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.30,1:08:58.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,How do we build agents for our own workloads?"
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.78,1:09:04.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, we have the Nvidia agent toolkit for enterprise AI.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.96,1:09:08.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,You've seen me build this in plain sight.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.16,1:09:16.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Almost everything that NVIDIA does, as you know, at every GTC, if you go back and look at my GTC 5 years ago or 10 years ago, you will see today.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.56,1:09:23.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,This you've seen me talking about for several years now because we've been building for this moment.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.64,1:09:32.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,There are four things that companies need in order to build agents as a service or build agents to operate.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.76,1:09:35.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,The first thing you need is you need models.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.72,1:09:42.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Of course, large language models, the smarter the better, the cheaper the better, the faster the better.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.48,1:09:47.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,The second is you need a harness to orchestrate the whole thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.68,1:09:52.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,The third, these eight these models want to use tools.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.40,1:09:54.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,And these tools come with it skills.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.96,1:10:01.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,And I showed you CUDA X libraries, those are going to be amazing tools for the agents in the future.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.52,1:10:04.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,And then lastly, you need a runtime.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.76,1:10:08.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,You need the operating system that holds it all together.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.28,1:10:12.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the NVIDIA toolkit for agents.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.44,1:10:18.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,It includes it includes models that you can modify.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.95,1:10:22.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,NVIDIA's world-class open models, I want to show you more.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.64,1:10:25.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,You can run agents from anybody.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.03,1:10:31.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,You could run uh Claude code, incredible agent, Codex, incredible agent.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.31,1:10:38.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,You could run it inside this harness called OpenShell, which will be highly secure for your inside the enterprise.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.92,1:10:46.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,The shell protects the agent, keeps it grounded in security policies.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.68,1:10:48.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Privacy is protected.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.76,1:10:51.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Its rights and privileges are given.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.32,1:10:53.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,Its identity is protected.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.43,1:10:57.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, this OpenShell is being adopted all over the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.33,1:10:59.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,NVIDIA OpenShell is open source.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.00,1:11:02.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're going to see so many companies adopt it.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.41,1:11:07.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Red Hat, Canonical, Microsoft, it's going to be adopted everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.56,1:11:10.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is an important This is the runtime.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.96,1:11:16.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,And this runtime is fully optimized for the NVIDIA AI platform.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.40,1:11:17.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Which is everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.60,1:11:24.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, you can run OpenShell in any cloud, on prem, and even on device.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.56,1:11:29.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, you have you have now tools and libraries that they can use.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.88,1:11:33.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,You have models that you can modify or use as is.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.34,1:11:35.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Or you have agents.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.40,1:11:42.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is OpenClaw, Hermes, another incredible another incredible harness.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.78,1:11:48.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,These agent agentic harnesses can now run on prem or for you anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.48,1:11:49.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.27,1:11:55.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, four things and this represents the operating system of the modern enterprise.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.44,1:11:57.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, how do we use this?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.72,1:12:03.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,One of my favorite use cases of agents is chip designers.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.52,1:12:07.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,It is the single most important thing that NVIDIA does.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.44,1:12:13.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, of course, we have to partner with Cadence to build super agent.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.36,1:12:16.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,A chip design super agent.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.36,1:12:21.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,It is orchestrated by Codex or Claude Code.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.60,1:12:30.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,It has RTL and architecture diagrams or schematics or uh specifications as input and whatever you need to fix.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.52,1:12:41.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,And together, we created some super agents that are optimized for the NVIDIA runtime with Nemotron.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.20,1:12:41.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,And let's take a look.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.04,1:12:46.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's really incredible.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.44,1:12:51.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Cadence and NVIDIA are partnering to build chip design agents.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.52,1:12:59.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Hundreds of thousands of NVIDIA chips come together to make the AI factories that power the world's frontier AI models.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.20,1:13:04.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Designing these chips and the systems they run in is one of the hardest engineering challenges.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.04,1:13:09.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Trillions of transistors, three-dimensional circuits, microscopic scale.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.01,1:13:18.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Every gate, every wire synchronized to picoseconds must work in perfect harmony with no margin for error.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.64,1:13:21.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,Physical prototypes are too slow and too costly.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.34,1:13:24.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, engineers work in the digital realm.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.20,1:13:32.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Each chip begins as a set of architectural specifications, then translated into RTL, the language of chip design.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.20,1:13:34.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,RTL must be verified in simulation.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.76,1:13:37.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,A single bug can delay a chip by months.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.60,1:13:45.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,At NVIDIA, thousands of engineers, billions of computer hours per year, millions of tests written, run, and debugged.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.36,1:13:47.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,A cycle that takes teams weeks.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.92,1:13:53.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,To compress this cycle, Cadence and NVIDIA built a design verification agent.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.12,1:13:55.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Codex orchestrates the process.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.28,1:13:59.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Cadence ChipStack launches the RTL verification loop.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.28,1:14:03.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Powered by Nemotron and secured by NVIDIA OpenShell.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.28,1:14:10.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Calling on expert sub-agents in RTL generation, test bench creation, regression testing, and debug.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.04,1:14:13.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,The system drives itself.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.08,1:14:19.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,The ChipStack agents run hundreds of simulations with Cadence Xcelium, formal verification with Jasper.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.68,1:14:21.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,Design flaws revealed.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.34,1:14:23.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Bugs in the code fixed.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.96,1:14:26.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,What once took weeks now takes hours.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.68,1:14:30.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Verification cycles over 40 times faster.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.80,1:14:38.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Together, NVIDIA and Cadence are reinventing chip design with AI agents.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.32,1:14:41.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,From weeks from weeks to hours.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.76,1:14:43.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,From weeks to hours.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.25,1:14:44.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,From weeks to hours.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.65,1:14:47.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,NVIDIA has thousands of chip designers.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.23,1:14:53.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,We are going to hire hundreds of thousands of Cadence super agents that work with
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.70,1:14:59.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,us so that we can accelerate our company so that we can be even more ambitious,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.14,1:15:02.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,create even more amazing things, run even faster.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.48,1:15:10.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,You saw earlier that the toolkit with models harness tools
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.68,1:15:14.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,The tools in this case are Cadence simulators and verifiers,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.49,1:15:16.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,formal verification systems.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.05,1:15:24.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,It is the reason why we're working with Cadence so hard to accelerate all of their tools on CUDA because the agents are impatient.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.92,1:15:27.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,The agents want the answer immediately.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.92,1:15:37.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so models harnesses accelerated CUDA accelerated libraries and tools and then the runtime.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.88,1:15:41.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,What you saw just now is all of that coming together.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.80,1:15:51.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, one of the things that it starts with is a great model that Cadence could modify and tune to be expert at the Cadence workflow,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.52,1:16:02.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,at the Cadence expertise so that they could create super agents that are proprietary to Cadence with their proprietary knowledge.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.20,1:16:04.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,They have to start with an excellent model.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.19,1:16:05.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,We call it Nemotron.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.04,1:16:14.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Nvidia is dedicated to build open models for the world so that all of you, all of us could create our own agents.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.56,1:16:22.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Today we're announcing the Nemotron 3 Ultra.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.16,1:16:24.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yep, our next open model.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.56,1:16:30.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,And it is smart.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.88,1:16:39.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Nemotron models not only give you the model we give you all the data that we used to train the model.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.56,1:16:45.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,And because we have a coalition of incredible partners, you can see all of our partners down here.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.00,1:16:50.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,We work together, contribute data to each other.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.52,1:16:56.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,Nemotron is trained on one of the largest suites of long-running reasoning models,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.42,1:17:02.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,long-running tool task solving, tool using data sets in the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.84,1:17:13.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,Because of all of our great partnerships, all of this from the model, the training script, and the data made all completely available to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.59,1:17:16.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is open models at its best.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.76,1:17:20.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,The best open model system policies in the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.68,1:17:27.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Simple goal is so that you can take all of it, add to it, make it even better, make it yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.32,1:17:33.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Nemotron 3 Ultra is five times faster.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.48,1:17:42.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the world's first model based on a hybrid architecture of SSM, state space models, with mixture of experts.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.00,1:17:45.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,The architecture is incredibly fast.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.53,1:17:48.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,We made it faster that you could think fast.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.07,1:17:51.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,When you think fast, you could think longer at the same cost.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.96,1:17:54.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, five times faster.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.80,1:18:06.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,It is also 30% cheaper, 30% lower cost to run in total flops, in total inference time, than even the most cost-effective in the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.56,1:18:09.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're comparing against the world's best open models.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.00,1:18:12.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Frontier smart.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.36,1:18:14.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Five times faster.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.52,1:18:16.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,30 point 30% cheaper.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.00,1:18:19.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Completely open.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.12,1:18:20.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're completely dedicated to this.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.98,1:18:22.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is now Nemotron 3.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.50,1:18:25.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're currently working on Nemotron 4.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.96,1:18:33.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, this entire toolkit from models, harnesses, tools and skills,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.60,1:18:39.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,and runtimes is the reason why every enterprise company in the world has the
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.64,1:18:45.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,ability now to create their own agents just like Cadence did with their super agents.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.59,1:18:52.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we're working with so many companies, Cadence and CrowdStrike and Dassault and Palantir, SAP and ServiceNow.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.47,1:18:58.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,People were always said, "Jensen, the agents are going to disrupt these markets."
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.80,1:19:02.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,I said completely opposite and you can now see it.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.17,1:19:08.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,Agents is going to create the largest opportunity ever for my partners and friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.14,1:19:16.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we have the Nemo the the NVIDIA agentic toolkit for enterprise AI to help them.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.96,1:19:23.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, there you go.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.60,1:19:27.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,First, Vera Rubin in full production.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.12,1:19:32.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Two, Vera CPU, CPU built for a new generation for agents.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.93,1:19:34.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,And three,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.16,1:19:39.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,NVIDIA's enterprise AI toolkits so that every enterprise
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.62,1:19:44.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,and every enterprise software
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.14,1:19:53.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,company can build agents.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.68,1:19:58.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,My relationship with you started here.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.52,1:20:07.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,And many of you, many of you, many of my friends and partners here in Taiwan, your companies started here.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.20,1:20:14.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is in a lot of ways the beginning of the modern computer industry, 40 years now.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.44,1:20:16.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,NVIDIA's 33 years old.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.68,1:20:27.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,The PC industry was already starting to get to Windows 1 and Windows 2 and Apple Apple 1 and Apple 2 and by the time that we came along,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:27.88,1:20:31.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Windows 3.1 was the PC.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.36,1:20:36.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,And as you know, Windows 95 made PC personal.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.20,1:20:43.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,It took PC from enterprises, com- companies, and made it into a consumer electronics device.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.68,1:20:46.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Everybody should have one, and everybody does.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.68,1:20:48.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.32,1:20:53.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,This computing platform did several things incredibly smart.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.40,1:20:56.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Windows was not just disaggregated, as you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.64,1:20:59.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Windows was properly abstracted.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.25,1:21:01.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,It was architected just right.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.68,1:21:10.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Systems BIOSes, open chipsets, the operating system with drivers,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.80,1:21:15.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,drivers that could be connected and installed at runtime.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.20,1:21:25.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,And an abstraction layer with a multimedia API that was that opened up the PC to what we all know today.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:25.64,1:21:31.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Each one of these elements were essential in making the PC so popular.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.00,1:21:39.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,40 years later, Microsoft and Nvidia are going to reinvent the PC.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.72,1:21:42.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is going to be the new PC.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.88,1:21:48.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, tomorrow night, tomorrow night, I think it's tomorrow night our time, but I'm going to be with Satya.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.87,1:21:53.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're going to talk a lot more about the work that we're doing together.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:53.12,1:21:56.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Microsoft and Nvidia, over the last 3 years,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.48,1:22:04.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,it took this long to completely reinvent how the PC's going to work, so that we could be ready for this moment.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.08,1:22:11.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,As I mentioned earlier, that compute pattern called the agent is going to run in AI clouds.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.60,1:22:14.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's going to run inside enterprises.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.52,1:22:18.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,It is also going to run on your PC.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.44,1:22:22.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,What's going to happen to that PC when it has an autonomous agent?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:22.76,1:22:26.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,An agent that's helping you, that understands you.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:26.24,1:22:27.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,You could talk to it.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.16,1:22:28.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,It could look at you.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.69,1:22:35.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,You could ask it to refile those, go help you do some research.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:35.28,1:22:37.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,It could do a lot more that I'll show you.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.64,1:22:45.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,But the new operating system is of course the old operating system plus large language models.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.48,1:22:51.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Large language models in a lot of ways is the modern version of DirectX.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.44,1:22:59.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,It has of course input and output, understands prompts, it understands computer vision, it can generate video, it can generate sounds.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.44,1:23:07.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,It is the modern extension, the intelligence extension of the PC, of a computer.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.28,1:23:15.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,On top of that, the application, as I mentioned before, is going to be replaced by now in agentic runtime.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.44,1:23:19.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,And that is the modern application and agent.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.28,1:23:23.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's now take a look at what it can do.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.36,1:23:26.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,It started with a spark.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.12,1:23:34.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,An idea to reimagine the PC for the first time in 40 years with the age of AI.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.84,1:23:39.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,What becomes of our personal computer in a world of agents?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.64,1:23:44.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,Agents running natively, connected to models, local or in the cloud.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.91,1:23:52.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Our personal AI, sandboxed for security, running continuously, getting work done.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.48,1:23:56.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,The chips and the OS must evolve.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.56,1:23:59.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Introducing RTX Spark.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:59.88,1:24:05.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Everything we've learned over 33 years distilled into one chip.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.88,1:24:14.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Blackwell RTX GPU with 6,144 CUDA cores, 1 petaflop of AI performance,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.72,1:24:23.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,a custom 20-core Grace CPU built in partnership with MediaTek, fused by NVLink.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.08,1:24:26.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,128 GB of unified memory.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.89,1:24:29.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,TSMC 3-nanometer process.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.92,1:24:33.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,70 billion transistors.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.84,1:24:39.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,And in close collaboration with Microsoft, a Windows platform for agents.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.04,1:24:44.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're reinventing the personal computer.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:44.12,1:24:46.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,For creating.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.88,1:24:49.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,For gaming.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.96,1:24:51.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,For agents.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:51.72,1:24:55.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the dawn of a new personal computing revolution.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.04,1:24:57.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,And it starts
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.33,1:24:58.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,with NVIDIA
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.43,1:24:58.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,RTX
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.80,1:25:14.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Spark.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:14.32,1:25:16.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Here it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.88,1:25:22.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Of course, I got to show you the most beautiful part, which is video games.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.08,1:25:24.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,It is It's also the closest to our heart.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.96,1:25:26.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is Forza.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.60,1:25:29.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is 007, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.52,1:25:32.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,The new 007 game, I'm looking forward to playing it.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.64,1:25:35.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,I look a little bit like him.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:35.28,1:25:44.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ladies and gentlemen, NVIDIA's RTX Spark laptops.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.44,1:25:51.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.76,1:25:57.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have too many things in my pocket.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.16,1:25:57.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.63,1:25:58.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:58.48,1:26:02.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the most amazing chip the world has ever built.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.36,1:26:07.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the N1X that we built in partnership with MediaTek.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.66,1:26:09.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,I think I saw I saw Rick earlier.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.83,1:26:10.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is N1X.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.63,1:26:12.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is a beautiful chip.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.76,1:26:19.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,And this is This is a a a chip that frankly would take 33 years to build.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.12,1:26:25.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the reason for that is because 100% of Nvidia software stack runs here.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:25.64,1:26:28.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you want to run digital biology, no problem.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:28.94,1:26:31.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you want to do seismic processing, no problem.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.80,1:26:33.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,You want to do astrophysics, no problem.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:33.68,1:26:40.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,Everything associated with CUDA, all the physics, all the biology, all the genomics, all the AI, no problem.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.07,1:26:42.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,All the computer graphics, no problem.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:42.78,1:26:52.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Every single application Nvidia has ever created and every single application that Windows has ever run.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:52.24,1:26:58.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Microsoft and Nvidia meticulously optimized everything so that this computer literally
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.98,1:27:06.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,runs everything the world has ever created plus it now runs agents.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:06.25,1:27:10.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,An incredible computer.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:10.15,1:27:15.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm so proud of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:15.40,1:27:16.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.92,1:27:22.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now I want you to keep that in mind in the next video I just I'm going to show you.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:22.32,1:27:25.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Just imagine everything here is going to run on your PC.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:25.57,1:27:37.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now that computer could have a local Nemotron 3 ultra model or Nemotron 3 super model or it could have Claude code or Codex
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.42,1:27:46.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,or some other model in the cloud or something on the network and it's going to it's going to work and do something amazing.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.48,1:27:47.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's play.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:47.96,1:27:50.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Every house starts as an idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.68,1:27:59.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Getting from idea to design takes a myriad of tools, expertise, and a lot of time.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.48,1:28:05.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now an agent running locally on RTX Spark can help me design a house using the tools on
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.64,1:28:13.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,my laptop with an open shell sandbox running the Hermes harness connected to Claude Sonnet in the cloud.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.20,1:28:19.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,I select the site, share my concept sketches and mood board of styles to inspire my design.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.56,1:28:27.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the prompt, a text description of the requirements and the design intent.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.04,1:28:29.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,My agent goes to work.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.21,1:28:38.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Using the tools on my laptop, it opens Rhino and starts modeling the site, shaping terrain, setbacks, and the building envelope.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:39.04,1:28:45.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Then it proposes building forms optimized for cost, comfort, and quality.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.76,1:28:49.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,With the form defined, my agent generates the interior layout.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:49.77,1:28:53.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Walls, circulation, rooms begin to take shape.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:53.40,1:29:00.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,I jump in whenever I want to adjust, to change.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.24,1:29:04.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,Doors, windows, and structural elements are placed automatically.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.67,1:29:11.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,My agent detects its own mistakes and fixes them.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.84,1:29:16.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,When I approve, the agent exports the model from Rhino into Blender.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.28,1:29:21.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Materials and object properties transfer with the design context intact.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:21.88,1:29:25.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,I fine-tune the materials, get the look just right.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:25.48,1:29:27.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,Then I pick the shots.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.11,1:29:29.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Blender renders the house.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:29.08,1:29:34.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,My agent, using generative AI with the Flux 2 model, makes them photo real.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.05,1:29:36.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,Multiple viewpoints, lighting conditions.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.84,1:29:45.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,What was once a complex workflow is now guided and simplified by my agent, working with on RTX Spark.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.88,1:29:55.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Design at the speed of imagination.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.52,1:29:58.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,PC in the world of agents.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.24,1:30:00.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,The developers are so excited by this.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:00.32,1:30:02.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is an incredible computer.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:02.12,1:30:11.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,All of the acceleration, all the software capabilities associated with it, working with every developer to make it incredible for all of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:11.20,1:30:14.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,The next one, Adobe.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:14.12,1:30:18.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Incredible tool suite, of course, used by tens of millions of people around the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.45,1:30:26.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,They have re-engineered the architecture, the core of Adobe Photoshop and Premiere, and they're releasing it for RTX Spark.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:26.68,1:30:27.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,It is twice as fast.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.98,1:30:29.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's already fast.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:29.16,1:30:30.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, it's going to be twice as fast.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:30.96,1:30:34.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,And it It's also designed to be agent-friendly.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:34.46,1:30:40.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,With its MCP server, it can now interact with agents on your laptop.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.24,1:30:49.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,The number of customers, the number of partners that are so excited to bring RTX RTX Spark to the market is just incredible.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.20,1:30:56.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,You know, this is the first across the lineup of PC reinvention for 40 years.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:56.76,1:31:02.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,And I'm just so happy that all of you and the ecosystem around the world has joined us.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:02.80,1:31:04.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is basically everybody.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:04.64,1:31:12.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,Everybody will RTX Spark and will be building incredibly smart and powerful and beautiful laptops with all of us.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.78,1:31:19.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:20.04,1:31:22.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,But that's not all.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:22.13,1:31:23.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's not all.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:23.80,1:31:28.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,RTX Spark is a reinvention of laptop.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:28.12,1:31:32.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,But in fact, Microsoft and Nvidia is reinventing all of PC.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:32.34,1:31:36.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,And today, we're announcing a whole new line.
