Dialogue: 0,1:32:38.28,1:32:40.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's running all the time.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.24,1:32:41.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,No meter anxiety.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:41.61,1:32:45.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,And it's sitting here connected to your whole house.
