Dialogue: 0,1:32:55.17,1:32:55.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Your everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:56.04,1:32:56.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Whatever you want.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:56.93,1:32:58.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Your security system.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:58.21,1:32:59.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,All connected to this.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:59.64,1:33:02.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,And this becomes your personal AI.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:02.54,1:33:04.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Your personal AI agent.
