Dialogue: 0,1:33:14.00,1:33:17.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we just keep getting it smarter and smarter and smarter.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:17.16,1:33:19.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,And meanwhile, this is sitting at home helping you do things.
