Dialogue: 0,1:33:51.16,1:33:54.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,8 TB per second of memory bandwidth.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:54.24,1:33:57.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,And this sits by your desk.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:57.80,1:34:03.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,You basically, if you're a developer of large language models, you're a developer of agents,
Dialogue: 0,1:34:03.18,1:34:10.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,having this sit by your desk gives you all the compute you need, and then when you deploy it, you put it into the cloud.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:10.26,1:34:17.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, there's something that if you look at this and think about this, something is happening here.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:17.88,1:34:25.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Remember, 15, 20 years ago, we used to have an idea called a phone.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:25.76,1:34:30.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Today, we have an idea called a PC.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:30.28,1:34:39.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Today, when you think about your phone, the one thing you don't do with it is make phone calls.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:39.56,1:34:42.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,You do just about everything else.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:42.16,1:34:48.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, that phone means something very different to you than a phone of the past.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:49.00,1:34:56.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,I am certain what's going to happen here is that the PC 10 years from now and the PC that you think about today,
Dialogue: 0,1:34:56.80,1:35:06.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,a tool whether you launch applications, click and type, and this PC is going to be completely different.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:06.84,1:35:09.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Here's my theory.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:09.12,1:35:18.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can totally imagine, just as every house today has a home theater, or many houses have home theaters, big TVs,
Dialogue: 0,1:35:18.80,1:35:28.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,lawnmowers, dishwashers, I could totally imagine that someday, there's actually an AI supercomputer in your house.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:28.44,1:35:36.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,And it's running all of your agents, it's running all of your assistants, and they're doing all kinds of things for you all the time.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:36.76,1:35:40.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,And you have to have it in your house, just like you have a home theater in your house,
Dialogue: 0,1:35:40.44,1:35:44.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,you have stereos in your house, you have game consoles in your house.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:44.40,1:35:48.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,You would have assist AI agent computers running in your house.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:48.92,1:35:56.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,And these in time becomes a lot more like R2-D2 to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:56.08,1:36:02.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,It becomes more like C-3PO to you than it feels like a PC to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:02.96,1:36:12.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,There is no question this reinvention of the computer is as big of a deal as the reinvention of the phone into what we now know as the smartphone.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:12.52,1:36:14.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, this is the beginning of that journey.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:14.81,1:36:17.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the beginning of a new line.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:17.96,1:36:19.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, we have a roadmap for this.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:19.93,1:36:22.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is a brand new product family for us.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:23.04,1:36:33.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,Every single generation of architecture we will have a desktop, a laptop, a workstation, and then a desktop, a laptop, and workstation.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:33.10,1:36:44.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the thing that I'm just incredibly pleased, incredibly honored is that 100% of the world's PC industry has joined us to reinvent the PC.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:44.84,1:36:55.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,A new line, a new beginning.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:55.46,1:37:01.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:01.48,1:37:08.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,As you know, a gentic AI is just a digital robot.
