Dialogue: 0,1:37:24.16,1:37:28.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're working on humanoid robotics computers, robotics computers of all kinds.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:28.26,1:37:30.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're working on self-driving car computers.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:30.94,1:37:33.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're working on satellites.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:33.64,1:37:35.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,You have GeForce, which is has tensor cores.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:35.95,1:37:39.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,I just talked about a whole new line of PCs.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:39.24,1:37:45.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Agriculture equipment, manufacturing equipment, heavy industry equipment will all be a gentic.
