Dialogue: 0,1:38:05.58,1:38:10.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,increase the utilization, the efficiency of the spectral efficiency.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:10.36,1:38:13.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, everything will run agents.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:13.20,1:38:16.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Today, Nvidia is largely in the center.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:16.52,1:38:25.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,But I am pretty certain that there will be tens of billions, hundreds of billions over time of agentic systems,
Dialogue: 0,1:38:25.14,1:38:28.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,agentic computers that are going to be running around the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:28.74,1:38:31.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,The biggest problem is data.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:32.04,1:38:39.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,In the case of language models, all the English and all the language that we have on the internet that we trained on was from the perspective of us.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:40.04,1:38:42.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,We wrote it and we're reading it.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:42.48,1:38:51.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,However, in order to create a data for AI, robotics, it has to be in the perception, the perspective of the robot.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:51.96,1:38:57.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,And most of the world's video data is from a third person, not first person.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:57.68,1:39:05.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, agentic systems, robotic systems, physical AI, the data is the hardest problem.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:05.92,1:39:08.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,You've seen us move up this ladder.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:08.25,1:39:12.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,We started with teleoperations, which is basically human demonstration.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:12.64,1:39:18.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is no different than the big breakthrough of reinforcement learning human feedback.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:18.28,1:39:19.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,This then we use simulation.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:20.04,1:39:21.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is where Omniverse comes in.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:22.01,1:39:26.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is no different than reinforcement learning ver- verifiable rewards.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:27.01,1:39:27.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:27.57,1:39:35.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, we use these systems to bootstrap the AI model, the physical AI model.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:35.80,1:39:40.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Eventually, we're able to learn from third per- third person,
Dialogue: 0,1:39:40.48,1:39:47.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,reprojecting it into first and now eventually through bootstrapping we have a world
Dialogue: 0,1:39:47.41,1:39:53.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,foundation model that can understand the physical world from any perspective you want.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:53.51,1:39:58.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Third third-person, first-person, outside in, inside out, doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:58.52,1:40:07.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is a big breakthrough indeed and today we are announcing Cosmos 3.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:07.44,1:40:13.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Cosmos 3 is the frontier of physical AI.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:13.24,1:40:15.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,We are at the frontier with language models.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:15.89,1:40:17.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,There's so many people working on it.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:17.95,1:40:22.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,However, in physical AI, we are absolutely the world's best.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:22.63,1:40:24.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,I am so proud of the team for doing this.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:24.72,1:40:28.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the foundation model for all of your work.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:28.40,1:40:34.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Whenever you want to create a robot, whenever you want to create a factory robot or a robot that works in a factory,
Dialogue: 0,1:40:34.60,1:40:45.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,any kind of robot there in that involves physical world, you now have a companion, a Cosmos 3 that can understand and reason.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:45.52,1:40:47.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,It can generate.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:47.20,1:40:49.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,It can simulate in the loop.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:49.07,1:40:51.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,It can even be the policy itself.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:51.42,1:40:54.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,It is on the top of leaderboards all over the all over the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:55.00,1:40:58.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,I am incredibly proud of Cosmos and today we're announcing Cosmos 3.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:58.97,1:41:01.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's take a look.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:01.84,1:41:05.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,The real world is infinite and unpredictable.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:05.32,1:41:10.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Physical AI needs data, but real-world data is impossible to scale.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:10.88,1:41:14.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,For physical AI, compute is data.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:14.68,1:41:23.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is Cosmos, an open frontier omnimodel for physical AI built on a new mixture of transformers architecture.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:23.12,1:41:29.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Pixels, action, sound and language flow into the autoregressive transformer which reasons,
Dialogue: 0,1:41:29.26,1:41:35.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,plans and instructs the diffusion transformer which generates what comes next.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:35.16,1:41:39.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Developers post-train Cosmos across embodiments and use cases.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:39.64,1:41:49.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,As a VLM, Cosmos watches the physical world, understands what's happening, describing scenes, and flagging what matters.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:50.04,1:41:58.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,As a world model, Cosmos generates physics-accurate synthetic video from an image, text, or video.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:58.56,1:42:03.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,As a simulator, Cosmos closes the loop for policy training and evaluation.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:03.84,1:42:13.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,And as the foundation of NVIDIA Omniverse, an action-conditioned world model, Cosmos predicts the future frame by frame.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:13.40,1:42:17.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Post-train Cosmos, and it becomes a world action model.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:17.72,1:42:20.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Perceiving, reasoning, planning,
Dialogue: 0,1:42:20.64,1:42:30.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,generating actions for robots of every kind, for everything that moves.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:30.44,1:42:37.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,A new kind of data, a new kind of teacher, generated by compute.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:37.84,1:42:38.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,Cosmos,
Dialogue: 0,1:42:38.50,1:42:45.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,the foundation for developers of
Dialogue: 0,1:42:45.66,1:42:55.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,the age of physical AI.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:55.24,1:43:00.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,This takes data plus compute gives you AI.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:00.48,1:43:04.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now that we have AI, compute is data.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:04.96,1:43:08.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, use Cosmos 3, train a whole bunch of AI models.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:08.62,1:43:10.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,Cosmos is such an incredible open model system.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:10.90,1:43:12.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's exactly the same as Nemotron.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:12.57,1:43:13.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,We open model.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:13.48,1:43:22.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,We open the data, and we even open how we trained it so that you could enhance it for yourself and turn Cosmos into your proprietary model.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:22.97,1:43:27.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,We have such incredible partners working with us in so many different industries.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:27.40,1:43:36.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, the model itself is the most, of course, the most understandable part of the AI stack, but the AI stack is very complicated.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:36.34,1:43:43.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,It has generators, the model, simulators, and the runtime.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:43.12,1:43:45.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,Just as Just as it is for agentic systems,
Dialogue: 0,1:43:45.98,1:43:56.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,these cars are essentially a physical AI agentic robot that is a is a autonomous vehicle has also this complicated stack.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:56.88,1:44:03.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Today, we're announcing Alpamayo 2, an open model for self-driving cars.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:04.04,1:44:07.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're working with car companies across the world.
