Dialogue: 0,1:44:19.51,1:44:23.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,The manufacturers represent 80% of the world's cars.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:23.09,1:44:31.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,We are going to have a whole lot of NVIDIA Hyperion systems that are able to run Alpamayo or anybody else's AV stack.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:32.00,1:44:34.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,We are also connected into mobility services.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:34.97,1:44:40.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Approximately 97% of the world's mobility services are connecting with us so that
