Dialogue: 0,1:46:00.24,1:46:05.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,The world's first reasoning autonomous vehicle.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:05.40,1:46:10.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you let it talk all the time, it will drive you crazy.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:10.28,1:46:15.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,But, we're very happy that it's talking to itself all the time.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:15.60,1:46:17.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's called thinking.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:17.08,1:46:18.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, Open my eyes is a reasoning car.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:19.04,1:46:23.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,The technology that we've created also applies to humanoids.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:23.28,1:46:26.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,Of course, there many new breakthroughs that has to happen.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:26.46,1:46:31.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,The NVIDIA Isaac GR00T is our humanoid robotic stack.
