Dialogue: 0,1:46:42.39,1:46:48.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,This represents GR00T platform, the Isaac GR00T platform.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:48.60,1:46:54.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Every one of our systems, as you can see, the exact same pattern, whether it's agentic system for the cloud,
