Dialogue: 0,1:47:03.36,1:47:10.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,And of course, in every single case, we build everything completely.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:10.48,1:47:16.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,We build everything vertically, completely integrated with co-design,
