Dialogue: 0,1:47:33.24,1:47:38.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,These robotic systems are so complicated, so many motors, so many sensors, so fragile.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:38.64,1:47:48.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,And yet we need to have a way to deliver these reference platforms just like we do with PCs and DGXs and clouds and self-driving cars,
Dialogue: 0,1:47:48.97,1:47:51.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,we now are going to do it for robots.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:51.05,1:47:57.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,Today we're announcing the NVIDIA Isaac GR00T, a reference humanoid robot, all fully integrated.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:58.02,1:48:02.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,25 degrees of freedom on the on each hand made by Sharpa.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:02.96,1:48:05.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,31 degrees of freedom on the robot.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:05.99,1:48:08.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,6 ft, 150 lbs.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:08.68,1:48:14.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Just like me.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:14.16,1:48:18.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,The first number is shorter, the second number is bigger.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:18.60,1:48:20.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, pretty close.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:20.56,1:48:25.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,And and this platform runs the new Thor and our entire software stack.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:25.92,1:48:35.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,Data generation stack, data simulation stack, the runtime, all integrated into a robot that is designed for everyone to use.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:35.34,1:48:43.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, we built this for higher education and university researchers because for them to build this is insanely hard to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:43.25,1:48:46.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so let's take a look at that.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:46.32,1:48:50.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,The next leap in AI is general purpose robots, humanoids.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:50.26,1:48:51.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,But building one is hard.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:51.98,1:49:00.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,Every team starts from scratch, stitching together simulators, teleop systems, data pipelines, and training infrastructure.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:00.26,1:49:03.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Months of setup before research can start.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:03.32,1:49:08.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,NVIDIA Isaac GR00T, an open development platform for humanoid robots.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:08.80,1:49:14.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Open models, simulation and training libraries, and data generators.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:14.16,1:49:16.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Plus the robot computer.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:16.92,1:49:19.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fully pipe clean, ready to go in hours.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:19.92,1:49:26.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,First, set up the simulation environment in Isaac Lab.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:26.80,1:49:34.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Capture demonstrations with Isaac Teleop on a real or simulated robot.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:34.24,1:49:41.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Generate synthetic data with Omniverse and Cosmos, scaling one demonstration into thousands.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:42.04,1:49:48.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Train policies, evaluate them in Isaac Lab Arena.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:48.88,1:49:50.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,Deploy through Isaac ROS,
Dialogue: 0,1:49:50.60,1:49:51.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,running on
Dialogue: 0,1:49:51.32,1:49:57.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,Jetson
Dialogue: 0,1:49:57.91,1:50:03.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thor.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:03.56,1:50:06.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,Every element modular, open.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:06.50,1:50:10.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Use ours or swap in your own.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:10.80,1:50:19.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,GR00T is powering robotics research across every discipline, for every domain, from research labs to factory floors.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:20.00,1:50:27.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,One open platform.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:27.72,1:50:30.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,And now, a new addition.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:30.28,1:50:33.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Isaac GR00T reference design robots.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:33.28,1:50:40.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Built on Nvidia's open platform, ready for frontier research for any lab, anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:40.36,1:50:42.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,The age of robotics starts here.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:42.92,1:50:48.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Nvidia Isaac GR00T.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:48.56,1:50:55.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,So many robots.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:56.00,1:51:01.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're working with just about everybody who's working on robots in the world or robotic systems in the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:01.32,1:51:03.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let me tell you what I told you.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:03.60,1:51:07.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,The computer industry has been completely changed.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:07.40,1:51:10.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,In the last 6 months, everything changed.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:10.72,1:51:22.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Everything changed because agents were realized and it converged with the latest frontier models and it made possible the AI to now do useful work.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:22.40,1:51:26.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,The computing pattern will repeat over and over and over again.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:26.52,1:51:35.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,This computing pattern of an agent that's a model, a harness that uses tools with skills and runs in a runtime.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:35.20,1:51:40.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,That runtime depends on whether it's in the cloud or on prem, on a PC or a robot.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:40.18,1:51:44.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,But the computing pattern is exactly the same for all of them.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:44.92,1:51:47.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,You will use different harnesses because of your preference.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:47.42,1:51:49.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,You will use different models because of your preference.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:49.98,1:51:52.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,You will improve them for your proprietary use.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:52.86,1:51:58.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,You would create sub super agents that you can rent to other people to help them do their work.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:58.88,1:52:05.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,This agentic platform, this agentic pattern Nvidia has an enterprise AI toolkit.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:05.48,1:52:12.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is a wonderful way for all of you to engage your AIs and for us it's a wonderful growth opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:13.00,1:52:16.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Vera Rubin is in full production.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:16.12,1:52:22.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Whereas Grace Blackwell was created to process AI, particularly inference.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:22.60,1:52:25.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Vera Rubin was created to run agents.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:26.01,1:52:27.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,It is in full production.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:27.51,1:52:29.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,It is much much more than a GPU.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:29.81,1:52:35.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,It is entire disaggregated, distributed agent processing system.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:35.88,1:52:39.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Nvidia has really become an infrastructure company.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:39.20,1:52:46.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,Not just a GPU company, not just a systems company, but an infrastructure company to help you generate the maximum revenues,
Dialogue: 0,1:52:46.66,1:52:50.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,the maximum profit and to get there as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:51.00,1:52:59.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,The agent world this new way of doing computing where you build CPUs now for agents, not for people.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:59.48,1:53:05.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,CPUs for agents has its own special requirement and our Nvidia Vera is revolutionary.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:05.68,1:53:08.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy about its RAM.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:08.20,1:53:15.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,The order is already is going to make it the fastest and the most successful product launch in our company's history.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:15.64,1:53:19.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Nvidia and Microsoft has created a whole new line of PCs.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:19.08,1:53:20.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is a new beginning.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:20.80,1:53:25.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,And of course, that exact same agentic pattern that I agentic processing pattern,
Dialogue: 0,1:53:25.82,1:53:31.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,computing pattern that I just described is also going to run on all kinds of devices.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:31.94,1:53:42.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,I mentioned PCs, but in the future, it'll be robots and satellites and base stations and factories, in the cloud, on prem, at the edge.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:42.07,1:53:50.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,This pattern, agentic AI system, this agentic computing pattern will be replicated in computers all over.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:50.11,1:53:54.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,How we think about the personal computer will very likely change.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:54.52,1:53:58.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,I want to thank all of you for your partnership, your friendship.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:58.58,1:54:01.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,We couldn't be here without everything that we do together.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:01.69,1:54:05.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,I am so proud of how you've been so successful this last year.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:05.88,1:54:09.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,The next year is going to be even more.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:09.17,1:54:09.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have one
Dialogue: 0,1:54:09.84,1:54:21.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,more thing for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:21.27,1:54:32.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's take a look.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:32.12,1:54:36.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,You ready, Taiwan?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:36.32,1:54:37.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:37.92,1:54:40.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,The keynote's coming at Computex.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:40.64,1:54:42.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Jensen showed the world what's next.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:42.76,1:54:44.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Useful AI has arrived.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:45.00,1:54:47.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,Agents working by your side.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:47.39,1:54:52.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,But in case you missed things we said today, we're going to break it all down for you, Taipei.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:53.00,1:54:55.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Agents used to be misunderstood.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:55.12,1:54:57.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Only movie stars had them in Hollywood.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:57.52,1:55:02.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now we all got teams making dreams come true, building companies from living rooms.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:02.58,1:55:04.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,But they need so much compute.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:04.54,1:55:05.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,We hear you.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:05.60,1:55:07.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's why we created Vera.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:07.80,1:55:09.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Rubin's law, the show is true.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:09.68,1:55:12.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,The cheapest tokens coming through.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:12.24,1:55:14.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,10 times faster inference heaven.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:14.33,1:55:17.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,More special agents than 007.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:17.28,1:55:19.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,BlueField keeps agents memory true.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:19.96,1:55:22.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, let's talk about it, CPU.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:22.28,1:55:24.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,50% faster, that's outrageous.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:24.48,1:55:25.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Not for Vera.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:25.48,1:55:26.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's built for agents.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:26.88,1:55:29.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,NVLink Fusion blends ASICs smartly.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:29.30,1:55:32.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Everyone's welcome to the NVLink party.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:32.32,1:55:34.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Well, if you like that introduction.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:34.80,1:55:35.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Zero Rubins.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:35.92,1:55:37.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,In full production.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:37.44,1:55:39.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Nemotron 3 Ultra leave the run.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:40.00,1:55:41.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,Five x faster work gets done.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:42.02,1:55:44.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,NeMo Guardrails keeps the guardrails right.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:44.51,1:55:47.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,OpenShell keeps the sandbox tight.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:47.12,1:55:49.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Your code migrated and reviewed.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:49.76,1:55:52.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,All before this song is through.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:52.72,1:55:56.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,AI is a five layer cake for revenue.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:56.30,1:55:57.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Make no mistake.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:57.56,1:55:59.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,Global AI clouds with lots of gigawatts.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:59.78,1:56:02.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Giga next keeps power lean, connecting dots.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:02.52,1:56:04.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Every watt optimized for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:04.40,1:56:05.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,So you can have your cake.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:05.84,1:56:07.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,And eat it, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:07.84,1:56:09.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,RTX marks the year.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:09.80,1:56:12.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Biggest PC moment in 40 years.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:12.52,1:56:14.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Agents powering our workflows.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:15.00,1:56:16.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Running anywhere Windows goes.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:16.80,1:56:19.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Harnesses run on CPU.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:19.36,1:56:21.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Models fly on GPU.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:21.80,1:56:24.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Cosmos build worlds that robots need.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:24.28,1:56:26.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Turning computing into synthetic feet.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:26.68,1:56:29.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Alpamayo reasons through.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:29.28,1:56:31.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Understand flows like people do.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:31.76,1:56:34.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Who is how they learn to move.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:34.32,1:56:36.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Learning skills and finding groove.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:36.68,1:56:39.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,You'll need trees powered by those.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:39.40,1:56:41.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's still just humanoid.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:41.84,1:56:50.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,Come
Dialogue: 0,1:56:50.86,1:56:58.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,on.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:58.08,1:57:06.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Come
Dialogue: 0,1:57:06.32,1:57:12.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,on.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:12.92,1:57:14.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,The future's bright.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:14.99,1:57:19.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Come see what's next.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:19.44,1:57:21.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Taiwan.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:22.00,1:57:32.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Welcome to Computex.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:32.96,1:57:36.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Dàjiā xièxie.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:36.28,1:57:37.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,HAVE A GREAT COMPUTEX.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:37.65,1:57:38.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Dàjiā xièxie.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:38.48,1:57:40.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thanks for an amazing year.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:40.56,1:57:43.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you for all your friendship and support.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:43.14,1:57:44.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:44.19,1:57:45.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Take care.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:45.24,1:57:48.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,Have a great Computex.
